      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "You can drop the image you want to alter in the load image node and resize it according to what works best for the checkpoint you are using. \n\nAs a rule of thumb, the resolution for the short side should be around 512 for SD 1.5 checkpoints and 1024 for SDXL checkpoints."
      ],
