    {
      "id": 316,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": {
        "0": 240,
        "1": 1460
      },
      "size": [
        740,
        120
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 9,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Keep the positive prompt short and clear. Change the second line with your subject, desired lighting, etc, but keep it simple. This is not FLUX so put the important stuff there and leave the RAW photo, architectural photography, etc... they are there to help the model produce some realistic results.\n\nBatch number is deciding how many images will be produced in one generation. "
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
    {
      "id": 317,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": {
