        110
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 10,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "I don't like using a ControlNet that is too strong because it chokes the model's creativity. I suggest keeping the lineart off or very low unless you need those details. If you activate it, try playing also with the end percent. The controlnet will influence more the image in the initial stages and then fade out. "
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
